        "definition": ".subckt POT100K top wiper bottom params: A=0.5\nRU top wiper {100000*(1-A)}\nRL wiper bottom {100000*A}\n.ends POT100K",
        "provenance": "Two complementary resistors representing a linear 100 kohm potentiometer, valid only for 0<A<1; endpoints use direct wiring."
      }
    ],
    "temperature": 27.0,
    "assumptions": [
      "Educational BB_OPAMP and generic diode models only; no hardware qualification, noise, slew or current-limit claim.",
      "Working revision 2 feedback and startup path preserved. Original failures retained.",
      "Four isolated RC low-pass stages plus buffered high-pass. Gain calibration separate from limiter and potentiometer.",
      "Limiter references derived from +/-12 V through dividers and buffers.",
      "Full endpoint represented by direct connection to potentiometer top; mute connects output follower input to ground. Intermediate settings use complementary 100k potentiometer segments.",
      "Budget: at most five normal tuning candidates followed by control, filter and overload verification."
    ]
  },
  "netlist": "* 10 kHz Wien oscillator: isolated four-pole filtering and calibrated output\n.temp 27\nVCC vcc 0 DC 12.0\nVEE vee 0 DC -12.0\nVSTART start 0 DC 0.0 PWL(0 0 1u 12 2u 0)\nRSTART start wp 1meg\nCWIEN1 osc w1 1n\nRWIEN1 w1 wp 15.8k\nRWIEN2 wp 0 15.8k\nCWIEN2 wp 0 1n\nXOSC wp nfb vcc vee osc BB_OPAMP\nRG nfb 0 10k\nRFIX osc nfb1 15k\nRVAR nfb1 nfb 10k\nDAGC1 nfb1 nfb DAGC\nDAGC2 nfb nfb1 DAGC\nXISOLATE osc isolated vcc vee isolated BB_OPAMP\nCHP isolated hp 10n\nRHP hp 0 15.9k\nXHP hp hpbuf vcc vee hpbuf BB_OPAMP\nRLP1 hpbuf lp1 10k\nCLP1 lp1 0 1n\nXLP1 lp1 b1 vcc vee b1 BB_OPAMP\nRLP2 b1 lp2 10k\nCLP2 lp2 0 1n\nXLP2 lp2 b2 vcc vee b2 BB_OPAMP\nRLP3 b2 lp3 10k\nCLP3 lp3 0 1n\nXLP3 lp3 b3 vcc vee b3 BB_OPAMP\nRLP4 b3 lp4 10k\nCLP4 lp4 0 1n\nXLP4 lp4 filtered vcc vee filtered BB_OPAMP\nXCAL filtered calfb vcc vee cal BB_OPAMP\nRCALG calfb 0 10k\nRCALF cal calfb 1350\nRPT vcc pref 14k\nRPB pref 0 10k\nRNT vee nref 14k\nRNB nref 0 10k\nXPR pref clp vcc vee clp BB_OPAMP\nXNR nref cln vcc vee cln BB_OPAMP\nRIN cal lim 1k\nDCLP lim clp DCLAMP\nDCLN cln lim DCLAMP\nXLIM lim top vcc vee top BB_OPAMP\nXOUT top out vcc vee out BB_OPAMP\nRLOAD out 0 10k\nXPOT top wiper 0 POT100K A=0.5\n.model DAGC D(Is=1e-14 N=1.8 Rs=10 Cjo=1p)\n.model DCLAMP D(Is=1e-14 N=1.2 Rs=1 Cjo=1p)\n.subckt POT100K top wiper bottom params: A=0.5\nRU top wiper {100000*(1-A)}\nRL wiper bottom {100000*A}\n.ends POT100K\n.subckt BB_OPAMP plus minus vp vn out params: A0=100000 GBW=10000000\nEopen pole_in 0 plus minus {A0}\nRdominant pole_in pole 1k\nCdominant pole 0 {A0/(6.283185307179586*GBW*1000)}\nBlimit out 0 V=min(max(V(pole),V(vn)+0.1),V(vp)-0.1)\n.ends BB_OPAMP\n.end\n",
